      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2015 SPLF. Published by Elsevier Masson SAS. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Epicardial fat necrosis is a rare cause of benign chest pain. Its physiopathological mechanism is unknown. Diagnosis is easily performed through radiological investigations that show a round opacity of fat density limited by a dense pseudo-capsule in the anterior mediastinum, close to the heart."
      },
